{
  "description": "The readiness checklist shared by the Mac (ReadinessChecklist) and the desktop client (soyeht_client::readiness). `connected` is whether the client has a connection to the engine; `result` is the answer to `engine.readiness`, or null before one arrived. Both clients pass every case.",
